SUMMARY:Tech Talks Conference — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:A day of computing and cybersecurity talks from industry and academic speakers — ideas talks\, deep technical sessions\, and true-crime incident stories\, in 25 and 50 minute slots. Morning tea (11:45am–12pm) and lunch (1–1:45pm) provided — indicate dietary requirements when registering on Humanitix. https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/tech-talks/
LOCATION:Birch Building (#35)\, Science Road\, ANU\, Acton ACT 2601
URL:https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/tech-talks/
END:VEVENT
