SUMMARY:BushBash CTF Launch — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:The 48-hour BushBash CTF goes live at 5pm — doors open from 4:45pm. Form a team\, meet other players\, and start capturing flags across OSINT\, Rev\, Pwn\, Web\, Crypto and Misc. https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/ctf-launch/
LOCATION:Melville Hall (#12)\, University Avenue\, ANU\, Acton ACT 2601
URL:https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/ctf-launch/
END:VEVENT
