SUMMARY:BushBash CTF — Day Two — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:The competition continues all day in Melville Hall\, with non-technical brain-break activities like GeoGuessr and Wikipedia racing alongside the main board. https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/bushbash-ctf-day-two/
