SUMMARY:BushBash CTF Finale & Prizes — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:The final hours of the CTF — flags close at 5pm sharp. Then from 5:00–5:30pm\, Kylie McDevitt (CEO) and Silvio Cesare (CTO) of InfoSect co-present the closing ceremony\, prizes and award certificates — followed by pizza. https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/ctf-finale/
LOCATION:Melville Hall (#12)\, University Avenue\, ANU\, Acton ACT 2601
URL:https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/ctf-finale/
END:VEVENT
